# Source: Ventrax AV4 report. Acceptance specification; execution is verified separately.
Feature: MQTT access and SmartGN dashboard

  Scenario: Authorize a device to publish telemetry
    Given a device has a valid identifier and association version
    When an internal service requests MQTT authorization
    Then the broker creates its credentials and allowed telemetry topic

  Scenario: Display the authenticated dashboard
    Given a user has signed in with a valid session
    When the user opens the SmartGN dashboard
    Then the application displays the summary allowed for the user role
